  Tool: finish
  Result: The bug in the FileStorage.retrieve() method has been fixed by normalizing the reference to support bare filenames without extensions as well as full paths, consistent with the docstring promise. The fix was applied to both sandbox and non-sandbox retrieval branches. Relevant tests for bare filename retrieval and missing keys passed successfully, confirming the fix. You can now use retrieve() with either full paths or bare filenames as expected.
